  "can_do": [
    "I can ask <i>What, Where, When, Who, Why</i> and <i>How</i> questions about people, places and things.",
    "I can use <i>How old, How many</i> and <i>How much</i> correctly.",
    "I can answer the Speaking Part 1 questions about myself in full sentences."
  ],
  "summary": [
    "Question words go first: <b>What, Where, When, Who, Why, How</b> and <b>Which</b>.",
    "After the question word comes the helper verb — <i>be</i>, <i>do</i> or <i>does</i> — then the person.",
    "<i>How old</i>, <i>how many</i> and <i>how much</i> add a second word to <i>how</i>.",
    "Answer Speaking Part 1 questions in full sentences, not just one word.",
    "Never repeat the verb: it's <i>What's your name?</i>, not <i>What's your name is?</i>"
  ]
